[I] Configure and test 802.15.4 devices

[T] wpan-tools provides the iwpan utility for configuring IEEE 802.15.4
[T] low-rate wireless personal area network devices through the Linux
[T] nl802154 netlink interface, plus the wpan-ping tool for testing links
[T] between devices.

[U] http://wpan.cakelab.org/

[A] Wpan-tools Authors
